Package: cogitem
Type: Package
Title: Rule-Based Automatic Generation of Raven-Like Matrix Items
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mehmet Cahit", "Marangoz", email = "cahitgs@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates Raven-like 3x3 figural matrix items from an explicit
    item model: a figural carrier (15 shape families) crossed with a relational
    rule (constant, distribution of two or three, two-axis progression,
    rotation, mirror, figure addition, subtraction and multiplication, and the
    bitwise logic rules AND, OR, XOR and XNOR). Every item carries a visual
    uniqueness guarantee for its response options, a reproducible seed and a
    design-feature record that can be used directly as a Q-matrix in linear
    logistic test model (LLTM) analyses. Items are drawn with 'grid' and
    administered in a bundled 'shiny' application that logs responses,
    response times and hover traces.
